  <section class="apdp-tail apdp-tail-faq apdp-shell apdp-dialfit-full alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-dialfit-section" aria-labelledby="AltaeronFaq-{{ section.id }}">
    {% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '10', title: 'Frequently Asked Questions', heading_id: 'AltaeronFaq' %}
    <div class="apdp-tail-accordion">
      <details><summary>What does the dial actually do?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>The dial adjusts the tension around the brace, letting you fine-tune how secure and supportive it feels around your knee.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do I need the Left or Right version?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>Choose the side that matches the knee you plan to wear it on. DialFit has separate Left Knee and Right Knee versions.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How do I choose my size?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>Use the Size Guide and choose according to the manufacturer's body-weight range.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I use it for walking, stairs or workouts?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>Yes. DialFit is designed for active movement such as walking, stairs, gym training, running, hiking and everyday activities.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I wear it during a long work shift?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>Yes. The adjustable design is useful for people who spend long periods standing or walking, including nurses, teachers, retail workers, hospitality staff and other on-your-feet jobs.</p><p>You can adjust the tension as your comfort needs change throughout the day.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How tight should I wear it?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>DialFit should feel snug and supportive, not painfully tight.</p><p>If you experience numbness, tingling, unusual swelling or discomfort, loosen or remove it.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Is it bulky?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>No. DialFit uses a lightweight stretch construction designed to provide support without the bulk of many traditional rigid knee braces.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What if I have arthritis, stiffness or an existing knee problem?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>For knees that feel stiff, achy or less confident during walking, stairs or everyday movement, DialFit provides adjustable external support that can help the knee feel more secure while worn.</p><p>It is not intended to diagnose, cure or repair an underlying joint condition or injury.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What if I also have varicose veins or heavy legs?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>DialFit is designed for knee support rather than vein treatment.</p><p>People who spend long periods standing or walking — including those who also experience tired or heavy legs — may use it for additional knee-focused support during the day.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Who is DialFit designed for?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>DialFit is designed for people who want extra adjustable knee support during everyday movement.</p><p>That includes walking, stairs, workouts, long work shifts, travel, housework, gardening and physically demanding jobs involving standing, lifting, carrying or bending.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Is DialFit suitable for physically demanding work?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>It can be used for additional knee support during jobs involving long periods of standing, walking, lifting, carrying, bending or climbing.</p><p>The dial lets you adjust the tension as the demands of your day change.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can extra body weight make knee support useful?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>Extra body weight can make everyday walking and stairs feel more demanding on the knees.</p><p>DialFit provides adjustable external support that can help the knee feel more secure during movement.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can DialFit be used during pregnancy?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>Pregnancy can change body weight and how everyday movement feels.</p><p>If your healthcare professional says a knee support is appropriate for you, DialFit provides adjustable external support for walking and daily activity.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What if it doesn't work for me?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>You're covered by our 30-Day Money-Back Guarantee. Try DialFit during your normal routine and contact us within the guarantee period if it isn't right for you.</p></details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="apdp-tail alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-dialfit-section"><div class="apdp-shell apdp-dialfit-full"><div class="apdp-dialfit-guarantee">
    {% render 'altaeron-pdp-icon', icon: 'shield' %}<div><h2>Try DialFit for 30 Days</h2><p>Wear it. Walk in it. Use it through your normal routine.</p><p>If DialFit isn't right for you, contact us within 30 days and you're covered by our money-back guarantee.</p><p><strong>Secure Checkout • Free Shipping • 30-Day Guarantee</strong></p></div><a class="apdp-button apdp-button--primary" href="#DialFitFinalPurchase-{{ section.id }}">TRY DIALFIT RISK-FREE →</a>
